        {
          "q": "How far ahead should I order?",
          "a": "At least three days ahead, two to three weeks for a wedding cake. Rush orders when we can — ask on Telegram."
        },
        {
          "q": "What is the minimum weight?",
          "a": "1.5 kg, which is 8–10 slices. Tiered cakes start at 4 kg."
        },
        {
          "q": "Is a deposit required?",
          "a": "Yes, 50% when ordering and the rest on delivery. We accept cards, Payme and Click."
        },
        {
          "q": "Do you make sugar-free or gluten-free cakes?",
          "a": "We make a gluten-free cake on almond flour. Completely sugar-free, no, but we can make it less sweet."
